PURPOSE of /kernel/hw-enablement/removable-media/include

Library files for removable media tests. Not intended to be run standalone. Currently does the following:

Gathers test parameters from environment variables
Installs hwcert and dt test suite if needed
includes python bindings for running common shell commands and the dt test suite as well as methods for discovering partitions on the test device(s)

dt: http://www.scsifaq.org/RMiller_Tools/dt.html


